 "signs": [
  {
   "text": "HOLYHEAD MOUNTAIN. 220 m of rock, the highest point on Anglesey, with a Roman lookout on top. In Welsh it's Mynydd Tŵr. On a clear day you can see Ireland. Today is not the clear day. Hope springs eternal.",
   "x": 25.0,
   "y": 9.0
